a:T91d,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What can I create with RUHGEN?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Still images, image sequences, and short-form cinematic clips from text—or combine reference frames and style prompts. Pro and Studio add higher resolutions, longer outputs, and batch workflows."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does pricing scale for teams?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Free is for experimentation. Pro fits solo creators and small squads with pooled monthly generations. Studio adds seats, shared prompt libraries, audit logs, and priority infrastructure."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use outputs commercially?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes on Pro and Studio within the license terms in your agreement. Free tier is for personal exploration—upgrade before client or broadcast work."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer an API?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Studio includes REST hooks, webhooks on job completion, and signed URLs for assets so you can automate ingest into DAMs, MAMs, or custom render farms."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you handle data privacy?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Prompts and uploads are encrypted in transit. Retention defaults are configurable on Studio; we never sell your data or train on private Studio content without a contract addendum."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do seats and shared libraries work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Studio workspaces can add seats with role-based access. Shared prompt libraries and brand-safe style presets stay in sync so art direction doesn’t drift between contributors."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What happens when I run out of credits?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You’ll see a clear notice before jobs start. Upgrade your plan, purchase a top-up where available, or wait for your monthly reset—your drafts and prompts are never deleted."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which export formats are supported?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Common image formats plus sequence-friendly options for pipelines. Video exports target review-friendly codecs; Studio can expose additional formats and passes depending on your plan."}}]}11:X
